        role: "Hunting partner",
        exam: [.direct("What did you see on {DATE} in the woods?", "\"{V} and {D} were arguing over a dead buck. I saw {D} raise a rifle, and then {V} was shot in the leg.\""), .direct("What did ballistics show?", "\"The bullet matches {D}'s rifle. That's in the report.\""), .direct("What were {V}'s injuries?", "\"A thigh wound. The medical report documents it. {V} was bleeding badly and we got help fast.\""), .direct("How did the two of you end up arguing?", "\"We were hunting together at dawn. {D} took a buck, and {V} said it was {V.his}. They argued over the carcass in a clearing at about 7:30.\""), .direct("What did you see {D} do?", "\"{D} lifted the rifle and pointed it toward {V} while telling {V} to back off. {V} lunged to grab the barrel.\""), .direct("What happened after the shot?", "\"The rifle fired at 7:35. {V} dropped, holding a thigh. I took off my belt, made a tourniquet, and called 911 until medics came at about eight.\""), .cross("{DL} says the rifle fired when {V} grabbed it, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"I did see a struggle. It happened very fast.\""), .cross("Did you see {DL} pull the trigger?", "\"I saw the rifle raised and then a shot. I can't say for sure how the trigger was pulled.\""), .cross("Were you close?", "\"Close enough to see, but things were chaotic. I didn't see every moment of it.\""), .cross("Did you see a round in the chamber before the struggle?", "\"I did not check. I knew {D} had been hunting, so I assumed one was.\""), .cross("Did {V} grab the rifle before it fired?", "\"Yes. {V} got a hand on it and pulled. I cannot say who pulled the trigger.\"")],
