        openings: ("During a dispute over a dead buck, {V} was shot in the leg. A hunter saw {D} raise a rifle, and ballistics tie the bullet to {D}'s rifle. The State will show the report and the hunter.", "Jurors will also see a struggle in which both people grabbed the rifle, a tracker who saw it, and a shot that no one meant."),
