        openings: ("A person with a knife took $310 from a laundromat attendant at closing. A bus driver recognized {D} from the camera image, and a jacket matching the video was found in {D}'s home.", "The defense case is that a transit card places {D} on a bus at 9:50, two miles away, and that the jacket is a common style."),
