        summary: "A funeral home's back door was pried on {DATE} and jewelry was taken from two bodies prepared for burial. A pry bar in {D}'s truck matched the marks. {DL} says {D.he} was only passing.",
        state: [E(.forensic, 3, "Tool Marks", "The pry bar matches the door."), E(.document, 3, "Inventory", "Rings and a watch missing."), E(.video, 2, "Street Camera", "{D}'s truck near the lot.")],
        defense: [E(.statement, 1, "Passing", "{DL} says {D.he} was passing through.")],
        role: "Funeral director",
        exam: [.direct("What did you find at your funeral home on {DATE}?", "\"The back door had been pried open. Jewelry was missing from two bodies prepared for burial, including rings and a watch.\""), .direct("What did the tool marks show?", "\"A pry bar in {D}'s truck matches the marks on the door. The forensic report says it fits.\""), .direct("What does the street camera show?", "\"{D}'s truck near the lot. It was parked close to the funeral home that night.\""), .direct("How did you find the break-in?", "\"At about 8 a.m. when I opened the building. The back door was pried and the frame was splintered at the lock.\""), .direct("What was taken?", "\"Two rings and a watch were taken from two decedents prepared for burial. The families were devastated when I had to tell them.\""), .direct("What did deputies recover?", "\"A pry bar from {D}'s truck, which a tool-mark examiner matched to the door frame marks. They also traced a ring to a pawn shop.\""), .cross("{DL} says {D.he} was only passing, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"A truck on the street isn't proof of entry. I only know it was near the lot.\""), .cross("Is the pry bar a common brand?", "\"I'm told it's a common type. Many people own one. I can only say it matches the marks.\""), .cross("Did you see {DL} inside the funeral home?", "\"No. I wasn't there. I only saw the door and what was missing.\""), .cross("Was the pry bar a rare tool?", "\"No. It is a common brand sold in hardware stores. I cannot say how many exist in the county.\""), .cross("Did the street camera show someone at your back door?", "\"No. It shows {D}'s truck parked near the lot at about 1 a.m. It does not cover the back door.\"")],
