        openings: ("Facility security found 80 fentanyl patches in the locker of {D}, a nurse aide, after patients complained about empty patch boxes. A lab confirmed fentanyl. The State will show the patches and the complaint log.", "The defense evidence includes a coworker who admits storing a bag in {D}'s locker, an aide who never looked inside, and no witness to any patch being taken."),
